# 21. FINAL PRODUCT ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

KRESNA must demonstrate this complete user journey:

A new customer signs up.

They create a chatbot.

They upload an Excel FAQ and PDF documents.

They connect an API using an OpenAPI specification or simple REST configuration.

